{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/19757","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/19757/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/19757/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/19757/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/19757","id":647694700,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU2NDc2OTQ3MDA=","number":19757,"title":"CatmullRom3 Sets tension=0.5 if initialized with tension=0","user":{"login":"dskeithbuck","id":39964241,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTY0MjQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39964241?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dskeithbuck","html_url":"https://github.com/dskeithbuck","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dskeithbuck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dskeithbuck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dskeithbuck/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dskeithbuck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dskeithbuck/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dskeithbuck/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dskeithbuck/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dskeithbuck/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dskeithbuck/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":58674,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODY3NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2020-06-29T21:50:05Z","updated_at":"2020-06-30T21:45:31Z","closed_at":"2020-06-30T21:45:31Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"##### Description of the problem\r\n\r\nIf I generate a [`CatmullRomCurve3`](https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/blob/master/src/extras/curves/CatmullRomCurve3.js) with `tension=0`, the curve will actually initialize with a `tension=0.5`\r\n\r\n```javascript\r\n        const curve = new THREE.CatmullRomCurve3(\r\n          points,  // Tension\r\n          true,  // Closed\r\n          \"catmullrom\",  // Type\r\n          0  // Tension\r\n        )\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Bug**: `Tension = 0.0` looks like `Tension = 0.5`\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/39964241/86058848-5ec16180-ba16-11ea-98a6-fea46b22bc4d.png)\r\n\r\n**Expected**: Tension = 0.0\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/39964241/86059019-c7104300-ba16-11ea-82fc-4102877b92cf.png)\r\n\r\n_I'm achieving this look for the screenshot by setting `tension=0.001`_\r\n\r\nI believe this is caused by this code in the initializer:\r\n\r\n`this.tension = tension || 0.5;`\r\n\r\nWhich should be something like:\r\n\r\n```\r\nconst defaultTension = 0.5;\r\n// Handle `0` as a valid input\r\nthis.tension = (tension === 0 || tension) ? tension : defaultTension;\r\n```\r\n\r\n##### Three.js version\r\n\r\n- `0.109.0`\r\n\r\n##### Browser\r\n\r\n- [x] All of them\r\n\r\n##### OS\r\n\r\n- [x] All of them","closed_by":{"login":"mrdoob","id":97088,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3MDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97088?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/19757/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/19757/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}